<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 8-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 8-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia beat Luxembourg 8-0 (halftime 2-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group five qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Maxim Buznikin 11, Titov 19, Dmitry Khokhlov 54, 77, Alexander Shirko 73, 74, 84, 90</p>
<p>Attendance:</p>
<p>2,500</p>
<p>     Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A  PTS</p>
<p> 1. Israel		  5   4   1   0  11   2  13</p>
<p> 2. Russia		  5   4   0   1  21   3  12</p>
<p> 3. Bulgaria		4   2   0   2   7   6   6</p>
<p> 4. Cyprus		  5   1   1   3   6  10   4</p>
<p> 5. Luxembourg	    5   0   0   5   2  26   0</p>
</text>
